# Hand-written PDBx/mmCIF, not an archive entry.
#
# What it demonstrates: a file that states no connectivity at all -- no `_chem_comp_bond`, no
# `_struct_conn`.  The reader must return the atoms, all three coordinates and the annotation, ZERO
# bonds, and a log line naming the unbonded count.  Silence there is the defect this fixture exists
# to catch; inventing a C-C bond from the 1.5 A separation is the other.
data_TESTNOBOND
_entry.id   TESTNOBOND
#
